# Cursor Usage Router

Canon: `AGENTS.md`.

Use when managing Cursor-side sessions, prompts, or handoffs.

Session defaults:

- Plan runs: paste `documents/ai/templates/execution-scope-contract.md`; obey `.cursor/rules/agent_scope.mdc`.
- State position, authority, acceptance, and stop conditions before edits.
- Use current canon/spec or `documents/ai/templates/contract-brief.md` for behavior changes.
- Keep one PR purpose; split mixed work.
- Treat `plan only` and `audit only` as read-only.
- Re-verify other-chat conclusions against files and current canon.

